  "description": "In 1940, during a time of chaos, a man built a beautiful mansion on a remote island, Yeongchunhwa, solely for the sake of his wife whom he loved deeply. After a long time, the story of the couple involved in the mansion was forgotten, but one day, a mysterious 'manager' appeared and operated it as a lodging facility. He began inviting people who must love to the mansion, following the couple's souls...! \n\n *\"Welcome to Yeongchunhwa, a secret mansion that will bring you endless imagination. Any form of love is possible here. Love and indulge to your heart's content. As long as the mansion allows.\"*\n\nA luxurious mansion and people who visit it for various reasons. Erotic stories for women drawn by various writers are unfolding now.\n\n**Third Short Story *I've Loved You All Along:*** Do Han-Gyeol and Lee Sa-Rang win a free stay at the Yeongchunhwa Mansion through a university festival event. Though strangers, Sa-Rang's proactive attitude towards love soon leads them to the mansion.\n\n *“I like you... I've liked you since the moment we met...!”*\n\nThere, Han-Gyeol receives Sa-Rang's passionate confession. In truth, Han-Gyeol possesses the ability to hear the lies of anyone he touches. But strangely, Sa-Rang's lies remain inaudible. Every whisper of confession from her mouth holds not a shred of falsehood. \n\n*‘This can't be... What is this woman's true intention...?’*\n\nA woman pouring out her love and a man afraid to begin it. Where will this relationship lead?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
